! Document Templates

This wiki includes several templates to help you quickly create common legal documents. To use a template, open it and copy the content into a new tiddler.

!! Case Management

* [[$:/templates/NewCase]] - Create a new case file with standard fields
* [[$:/templates/ClientIntake]] - Record new client information
* [[$:/templates/DeadlineTracker]] - Track important dates and deadlines

!! Legal Research

* [[$:/templates/LegalMemo]] - Draft legal memoranda
* [[$:/templates/CaseLawCitation]] - Document case law citations
* [[$:/templates/StatuteCitation]] - Document statutory references

!! Using Templates

# Open the template you want to use
# Click "Clone" or copy the content
# Paste into a new tiddler
# Fill in the relevant information
# Add appropriate tags

!! Creating Custom Templates

To create your own template:

# Create a new tiddler with your template content
# Add the `Template` tag
# Use placeholder text like `<<field-name>>` for fields to fill in
# Document how to use the template

